OL,3,GNEWSA'Grass fire devastated our
OL,4,Abusiness community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndependent business owners say they
OL,7,Fare "devastated" after returning to see
OL,8,Fhow their premises were destroyed by a
OL,9,Fgrass fire which spread to a nearby
OL,10,Findustrial estate.
OL,12,FHalf the units on the Locking Farm
OL,13,FIndustrial Estate in Weston-super-Mare
OL,14,Fburned down in the early hours of 18
OL,15,FAugust, including an MOT centre which
OL,16,Fhad been trading for 30 years.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
