OL,3,GNEWSA'Grass fire devastated our
OL,4,Abusiness community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police arrested two
OL,7,Fteenage boys in connection with the
OL,8,Ffire, which is believed to have been
OL,9,Fstarted deliberately. They have both
OL,10,Fbeen released under investigation while
OL,11,Fenquiries continue.
OL,13,FMartin Fey, the estate site manager,
OL,14,Fsaid: "It's surreal to come back and
OL,15,Fsee what was a thriving business
OL,16,Fcommunity absolutely decimated."
